# ONCF-00R · Public website deploy compatibility.
#
# The Vercel project deploys the repository root as a static site (no build step). Since the
# platform core was consolidated into this repository, the root also holds a pnpm workspace
# (package.json, apps/, packages/, db/, docs/ …). This allowlist uploads ONLY the public
# website files, so the deployment stays exactly what it was before the consolidation:
# no package install, no framework detection, and no platform source served publicly.
#
# When a website file is added at the root, allowlist it here.
/*
!index.html
!contact.html
!favicon.ico
!logo.png
!img
!vercel.json
